                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e76bd9e5-478f-34da-9e0f-d75c5275fc54",
                        "entry_id": "de6f2067-56c4-3118-bcdb-558d3ac22302",
                        "glosses": [
                            "silly season; slow news day (time during the summer break when the media resort to reporting largely inconsequential stories)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "neuter",
                            "strong"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0d15e322-848c-406f-813c-37cfa0c83c33",
                                "sense_id": "e76bd9e5-478f-34da-9e0f-d75c5275fc54",
                                "text": "Bekanntlich is die Urlaubs- und Ferienzeit relativ arm an aufregenden Ereignissen, und wir sind längst daran gewöhnt, dass Politiker aller Couleur dieses Sommerloch durch ungewöhnliche Aktionen oder Wortbeitrage zur Selbstdarstellung nutzen.",
                                "translation": "As is well known, the holiday season is relatively devoid of exciting events, and we have long been used to politicians of all stripes taking advantage of this silly season for self-promotion through unusual actions or statements.",
                                "english": "As is well known, the holiday season is relatively devoid of exciting events, and we have long been used to politicians of all stripes taking advantage of this silly season for self-promotion through unusual actions or statements."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8a08f743-a17a-43a1-8f96-26bd3366cbf7",
                                "sense_id": "e76bd9e5-478f-34da-9e0f-d75c5275fc54",
                                "text": "So ein Sommerloch ist auch eine Chance. Zum Beispiel für Tiere, sie haben im Sommer regelmäßig ihren großen Auftritt. Erinnert sich noch jemand an Schwan Petra in Münster, die sich in ein Tretboot verliebte?",
                                "translation": "Such a summer slump is also an opportunity. For animals, for example, they regularly make their big appearance in the summer. Does anyone remember Petra the swan in Münster, who fell in love with a pedal boat?",
                                "english": "Such a summer slump is also an opportunity. For animals, for example, they regularly make their big appearance in the summer. Does anyone remember Petra the swan in Münster, who fell in love with a pedal boat?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
